{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>April Grove</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a load off, enjoy the scenery, chop a tree or two; the world of April Grove is yours to explore and savor.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Places_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades or even donate to the local wishing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Characters_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting trees with greater ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Chopping_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features that <i>April Grove</i>\u00a0has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mystical forest and meet its citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful world and OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize for your style of play with different foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622260?t=1749120079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/7a14d040d1cc3fd90768442f8977db4f1f772d52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749120079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/37707bbf3cb764c28126ace937344bb3813218f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749120079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/37707bbf3cb764c28126ace937344bb3813218f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749120079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3737320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>April Grove</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a load off, enjoy the scenery, chop a tree or two; the world of April Grove is yours to explore and savor.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Places_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades or even donate to the local wishing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Characters_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting trees with greater ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/Chopping_GIF.gif?t=1749120079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features that <i>April Grove</i>\u00a0has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mystical forest and meet its citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful world and OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize for your style of play with different foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Colorgrave"],"dlc":[3737280],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/a9d55ef46672a48580a3ac8ea7c06d23ac9339e1/header.jpg?t=1749120079","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142427,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142427/movie480.mp4?t=1747788657","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142427/movie_max.mp4?t=1747788657"},"name":"GAMEPLAY","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142427/f4e0609d9212e000e3fb379e8ad1566823584ca5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747788657","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142427/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747788657","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142427/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747788657"}},{"highlight":true,"id":25712134